+# Suggested Commands
+
+- Install locked development environment: `uv sync --locked` or `poe install`.
+- Focused tests: `uv run pytest -p no:cov path/to/test.py`.
+- Full tests: `poe test` (equivalent to `uv run pytest -p no:cov`).
+- Lint: `poe lint`; pass extra Ruff options as needed.
+- Format: `poe format`; check formatting: `poe check-format`.
+- Type check: `poe check-types`.
