+# Task Completion
+
+- Run the most focused relevant pytest module/test with coverage plugin disabled: `uv run pytest -p no:cov <test-path>`.
+- Run Ruff against changed Python files: `uv run ruff check <files>`.
+- For broad changes, run `poe test`, `poe lint`, `poe check-format`, and `poe check-types` as applicable.
