+# Tech Stack
+
+- Python >=3.10,<3.15; typed package (`beets/py.typed`).
+- PEP 517 backend: Hatchling; project/dependency metadata in `pyproject.toml`.
+- Dependency/environment manager: uv with locked dependencies.
+- Test runner: pytest, configured in `setup.cfg`.
+- Lint/format: Ruff; type checking: mypy; task runner: poethepoet (`poe`).
+- Documentation: Sphinx/reStructuredText.
